but words of totally different meaning, neither of which can ever be substituted for the other. *Affect* (apart from other senses in which it is not liable to confusion with *effect*) means have an influence on, produce an effect on, concern, effect a change in: *effect* means bring about, cause, produce, result in, have as result.
